Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That surely someday we\Njust might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we need\Nyou to help find our kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They all went missing three years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and not one of us has ever\Nheard from them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they have been lost at sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They were out playing in the\Nneighborhood when they disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, please look for them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Captain Toshiki here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we at least go talk to her? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,People say she really cares\Na lot about our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Captain Toshiki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We need her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no less a part of the G5\Nthan Captain Toshiki, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only do you doubt the Navy's report,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but then you have the goal to try and\Ntell us how we're supposed to do our jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,when we've been sent here to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you protest too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Too little, too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your kids are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They were lost at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Several times, too many to count, I discussed\Nit with Vergo, the G5's vice-admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:04:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and each investigation\Ncame to nothing! What, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just stay out of my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll kill every last one of you and\Nburn this whole city to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear enough for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Too clear, Commodore Yarisugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna talk to Tashigi, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd sure be nice if I\Ncould talk to her any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Too nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There he goes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But, unfortunately, Tashigi is the right\Nhand of Admiral Smoker in Unit 1! It's sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Too sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't help fools like you\Nwith a case from three years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a very busy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Too harsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll ever listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he was telling\Nus the truth when he said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,he already tried to get help\Nfrom Vice Admiral Vergo,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,though?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about all that, but Vergo\Ndid save this place from pirates before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed like such a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed\Nthat he was part of the G5.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So Vergo thinks they\Nwere killed at sea, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our children are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But where in the world could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yusuf, quick, make them sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can, but it's only going\Nto work so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Grown-ups, help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the withdrawals\Nfrom the drugs they've
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,been taking are causing\Nthem a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:05:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So how do we help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta do something, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami! Right, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's face looks so dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We need our candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't feel better without candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy! Candy! Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we can't hit them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare come on. They're just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we can't keep dodging\Ntheir attacks like this forever
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to venture a guess\Nhere and say it's because
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,somebody decided to blow up\Nall the little baby slimeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So that one is the parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, there was no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My word!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a hideous beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a frog now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's a lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it able to produce\Nunlimited copies of itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't think it's unlimited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The one on that side is shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then the other one should run out\Nof mass soon, but what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, maybe it's trying to fling\Nitself over here in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have it running\Nwild on this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,People are going to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it spews gas when you cut\Nit and blows up when you burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's way bigger\Nthan the ones from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamadouski!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do the rest of you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, we're going to the lab, too,\Nsince we have to stick together, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, Mosshead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wander off and get\Nseparated from Kin'emon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we're just gonna have to run all\Nover the island looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see a real\Nhole, Samurai, in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To the laboratory, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Smokey go, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And Captain Tashigi, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, even a bazooka\Nwon't break through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in. I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.06,0:10:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to lock down tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he does, the gas bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if we're stuck out here, then\Nwe're all going to be killed for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that. We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Those creepy slime things may\Nhave stopped falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But look, they're forming together\Nand getting really freaking huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get to a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our passmen cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They took our transponder snails!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't call out! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got us completely isolated!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is Caesar doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't say I know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But he did finally awaken\Nhis beloved pet Smiley, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume he's planning some\Nsort of big experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Vergo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have a steak for breakfast today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know you're wearing some?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little—I'd like to get a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,quick look at the experiment before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So everyone outside will die, probably,\Nbut don't worry—you're safe in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Virgo—those men out there, you\Nknow, they're all g5 soldiers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,g5 soldiers, right? They're your\Nsoldiers and you're leaving them to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's hard to believe we've\Ngot so many big names in one cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so funny. Seeing you\Ntwo locked up together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta that was where\Nyou guys caught me and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,smokey that one time\Nremember quiet you dumbass
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid pirates, don't you realize\Nthe gravity of the situation here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disgusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the worst case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes me sick too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Those news articles\Nweren't simple mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The reporters were deliberately\Nmisled because someone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,in G5 wanted those abduction\Nreports covered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So they worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar abducted those children and Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,passed all the incidents\Nof as accidents at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all people, the leader of\Nthe base was a double agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be characteristic of G5,\Nbut it's a disgrace for the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm lost, so he's a bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, though they\Nwouldn't really have noticed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he changed; he's been a traitor\Nsince the day that he joined the navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, Vergo is a pirate all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but why he enlisted in the navy on Joker's\Norders before he made a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He started at the very bottom and spent\N15 years rising through the ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker couldn't ask for a more reliable\Nor convenient soldier to work for him;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He works for Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, huh? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an underworld\Nbroker by that name as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I never smell a rat when\Nit was right there under my nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you shouldn't beat\Nyourself up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you should commend the rat for being clever\Nenough to elude the great white hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day you were\Ntransferred in from headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been on constant high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's irritating;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved I won't have to\Nkeep my head on a swivel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in control of the\Nsituation for a while now;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they won't suspect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, on the off chance\Nthat they do find out about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I assume you can figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Vice Admiral, Captain Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That way my secret never leaves this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let Caesar handle\Nthe soldiers outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It had to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This territory belongs to Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't allow anyone to walk out of\Nhere knowing his identity, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And yes, I'll report your deaths\Nas mere accident, as I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, who's this Joker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know Vergo because I know Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I worked for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker is just a fake name\Nhe uses on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you know him very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he? Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the deadliest pirates in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a member of the Seven Warlords,\Nauthorized by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don Quixote, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the bastard who\Nkidnapped these children!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That means something bad must\Nhave happened to Luffy's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do such a horrid thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The children are suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you take them away\Nfrom my warm, safe lab? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in a good place right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because you were holding\Nthem against their will?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's got a bounty of\N300 million and Lock powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're way out of our league!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what awful things you're\Nplotting here, and I don't care either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,These children told me\Nthey wanted to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine what their\Nparents are going through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So mark my words—we are\Ngetting them far away from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ask the children what they\Nreally want, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hamster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bad guy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna put you in that\Nlab and never let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to a word he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to trick you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you left me with no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let it go on like this, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.94,0:18:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid's hallucinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks there's bugs everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't turn your weapon on a victim!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't their fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take these chains off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These kids are gonna flip\Nout and smash us to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not getting anything\Ndone till we stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,children,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,look how powerful you've\Nbecome—that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This one should work well against gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Firebird Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving, kids, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I would simply explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your understanding of science is flawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can put out a fire\Nlong before it reaches
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,me because poison gas isn't the only kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The oxygen all around us is gas as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and what that means is that I can control\Nthe nearby air with the greatest of ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fire died out when I\Nremoved the oxygen around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we see what happens\Nwhen I remove yours as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Doorclad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.22,0:20:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I'm here, you're likely\Nwondering if Straw Hat ran into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with two other friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I made them suffocate just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Esther!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have plenty of candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm only giving it to the good boys\Nand girls who come back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you behave just a little while longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go back, but hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who tried to take\Nyou away are very, very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And because they hurt you so much,\NI'm going to need you to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just grab a pipe or a big rock\Nand crush their miserable skulls!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flicking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's brown bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's close, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally see the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, you're one of my\Ndutiful lackeys, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Left me for dead and\Nforgot about me already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only kidding, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All those awful injuries, why\Nit looks like you were shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I KNOW WHAT YOU DID!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Brownbeard, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You happen to be on our hit list, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fool, so it was easy to manipulate\Nhim, but now he's become a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.44,0:23:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need his services\Nanymore. Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.22,0:23:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cool Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do recall asking a favor from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And all this time, I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason to be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I underestimated your worth, but\Nit's all water under the bridge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.18,0:23:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it seems everything is just dandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, children!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:23:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better get aboard the\Nflying gas balloon outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.56,0:24:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault that you\Ntricked me. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.14,0:24:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bear that suffering on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.82,0:24:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't let my crew go through\Nthe same hell. Give them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking my men and leaving this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.12,0:24:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Your men?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing. You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall every last one of you, pledged\Nyour allegiance to me when you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the captain\Nof anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.58,0:24:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd all be dead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.34,0:24:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.58,0:24:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go after the kids! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.50,0:25:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All the little fools who\Ncouldn't make it in the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,new world will keep\Nworshipping me as their savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.34,0:25:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not good for anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.52,0:25:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I only keep them around as my guinea\Npigs, just waiting for their turn to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smash you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.26,0:25:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the nut!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Monet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I retrieved the children\Nwithout difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:26:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you prepare Smiley's food, as I asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed your instructions to the\Nletter, so everything is in good order.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As always.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.82,0:26:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And the video transponder\Nsnails are on standby outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.54,0:26:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.45,0:26:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So when my adorable little Smiley arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we can broadcast the experiment\Nfor all of our associates to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.98,0:26:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.83,0:26:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Connect me to all the receivers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A fun hello to all you\Nillicit brokers out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.86,0:26:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I do apologize for the short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.74,0:26:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're about to witness\Nsomething extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.74,0:26:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found the perfect opportunity\Nfor this demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.52,0:26:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a poison gas\Nweapon I've developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,much like the one you saw four years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.26,0:26:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but with some new features the\Ngovernment could never hope to recreate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, it just so happens that I\Nhave some uninvited guests on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to aid me\Nat my live test today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.06,0:27:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Intimidation, war, annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a variety of uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If it happens to tickle your fancy, I\Nwould be more than happy to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.84,0:27:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.94,0:27:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison doesn't seem like your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.70,0:27:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.22,0:27:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey, it never hurts to\Nwatch a little carnage, does it?
